---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "お役立ち記事一覧"
description: "外国人の雇用がはじめての方にも分かるように、在留資格や特定技能などの制度を、公的な一次資料をもとに基礎から解説した記事の一覧です。"
permalink: /articles/
navActive: articles
---
{% set root = page.url | relRoot %}
<div class="article-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumb">
      <a href="{{ root }}">トップ</a> ／ お役立ち記事一覧
    </div>
    <h1 class="article-hero-title">お役立ち記事一覧</h1>
    <div class="article-hero-meta">
      <span>外国人の雇用がはじめての方にも分かるように、在留資格や特定技能などの制度を、基礎から丁寧に解説しています。法令や出入国在留管理庁などの公的な一次資料をもとに書いています。</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="services-section" id="articles">
  <div class="container">
    <section class="post-start" aria-labelledby="post-start-title">
      <h2 class="post-start-title" id="post-start-title">外国人をはじめて雇う会社の方へ</h2>
      <p class="post-start-lead">まずは次の5本を順番に読むと、制度の全体がつかめます。</p>
      <ol class="post-start-list">
        <li><a href="{{ root }}articles/gaikokujin-koyo-hajimekata/">外国人を雇いたい。何から始める？6つのステップ</a></li>
        <li><a href="{{ root }}articles/gaikokujin-koyo-merit/">外国人を雇うメリット・デメリットは？</a></li>
        <li><a href="{{ root }}articles/zairyu-shikaku-visa-difference/">パスポート・ビザ・在留資格の違いとは？</a></li>
        <li><a href="{{ root }}articles/zairyu-card-check/">在留カードの確認方法とは？雇う前に見るポイント</a></li>
        <li><a href="{{ root }}articles/tokutei-ginou-kokuseki/">特定技能で外国人を雇うならどこの国？</a></li>
      </ol>
    </section>
    <h2 class="post-all-title">すべての記事</h2>
    {% set cats = collections.articles | categoryCounts %}
    {% if cats.length > 1 %}
    <div class="post-filter" role="group" aria-label="カテゴリで絞り込む">
      <button type="button" class="post-filter-btn" data-cat="all" aria-pressed="true">すべて<span class="post-filter-count">{{ collections.articles.length }}</span></button>
      {% for c in cats %}<button type="button" class="post-filter-btn" data-cat="{{ c.name }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ c.name }}<span class="post-filter-count">{{ c.count }}</span></button>{% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <ul class="post-list post-list--full" id="post-list">
      {% for article in collections.articles %}
      <li class="post-item" data-cat="{{ article.data.category }}">
        <a href="{{ root }}{{ article.url | noLeadSlash }}">
          <span class="post-meta"><time datetime="{{ article.data.datePublished | isoDate }}">{{ article.data.datePublished | cardDate }}</time>{% if article.data.category %}<span class="post-cat">{{ article.data.category }}</span>{% endif %}</span>
          <span class="post-title">{{ article.data.title }}</span>
          {% if article.data.description %}<span class="post-desc">{{ article.data.description }}</span>{% endif %}
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
(function(){
  var btns = document.querySelectorAll('.post-filter-btn');
  if (!btns.length) return;
  var items = document.querySelectorAll('#post-list .post-item');
  function apply(cat){
    btns.forEach(function(b){ b.setAttribute('aria-pressed', b.dataset.cat === cat ? 'true' : 'false'); });
    items.forEach(function(li){ li.hidden = !(cat === 'all' || li.dataset.cat === cat); });
  }
  btns.forEach(function(b){ b.addEventListener('click', function(){
    apply(b.dataset.cat);
    try { history.replaceState(null, '', b.dataset.cat === 'all' ? location.pathname : '#' + encodeURIComponent(b.dataset.cat)); } catch(e) {}
  }); });
  var h = decodeURIComponent(location.hash.slice(1));
  if (h) { var ok = Array.prototype.some.call(btns, function(b){ return b.dataset.cat === h; }); if (ok) apply(h); }
})();
</script>
